---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Comunidad | NeuroFamilia">
  <div class="app-layout">
    <aside class="sidebar glass-card">
      <div class="sidebar-header">
        <a href="/" class="nav-logo">
          <span class="logo-icon">🧠</span>
          <span class="logo-text">NeuroFamilia</span>
        </a>
      </div>

      <nav class="sidebar-nav">
        <a href="/app" class="nav-item">
          <span class="nav-icon">📊</span>
          <span>Dashboard</span>
        </a>
        <a href="#contenido" class="nav-item">
          <span class="nav-icon">📚</span>
          <span>Contenido</span>
        </a>
        <a href="#quizzes" class="nav-item">
          <span class="nav-icon">🧠</span>
          <span>Quizzes</span>
        </a>
        <a href="#progreso" class="nav-item">
          <span class="nav-icon">📈</span>
          <span>Progreso</span>
        </a>
        <a href="#comunidad" class="nav-item active">
          <span class="nav-icon">👥</span>
          <span>Comunidad</span>
        </a>
        <a href="#coaching" class="nav-item">
          <span class="nav-icon">🎓</span>
          <span>Coaching</span>
        </a>
      </nav>

      <div class="sidebar-footer">
        <div class="user-info">
          <div class="user-avatar">M</div>
          <div class="user-details">
            <span class="user-name">María González</span>
            <span class="user-plan">Plan Pro</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <button class="logout-btn">Cerrar sesión</button>
      </div>
    </aside>

    <main class="main-content">
      <header class="topbar">
        <div class="topbar-left">
          <h1>Comunidad de padres 👥</h1>
          <p class="topbar-subtitle">Conectá con otros padres y compartí experiencias</p>
        </div>
        <div class="topbar-right">
          <button class="btn btn-primary">+ Nueva publicación</button>
        </div>
      </header>

      <div class="community-tabs">
        <button class="tab-btn active">Feed</button>
        <button class="tab-btn">Grupos</button>
        <button class="tab-btn">Eventos</button>
        <button class="tab-btn">Mentores</button>
      </div>

      <div class="community-content">
        <div class="feed-section">
          <div class="post-card glass-card">
            <div class="post-header">
              <div class="post-avatar" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #10b981, #059669);">L</div>
              <div class="post-author">
                <span class="author-name">Luis Ramírez</span>
                <span class="author-time">Hace 2 horas</span>
              </div>
              <span class="post-tag">Pregunta</span>
            </div>
            <div class="post-content">
              <p>¿Alguien más ha tenido problemas con el sueño de su hijo de 3 años? Nuestro pequeño se despierta varias veces en la noche y no sabemos cómo ayudarlo. Hemos probado varias rutinas pero nada parece funcionar.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="post-tags">
              <span class="tag">Sueño</span>
              <span class="tag">Primera infancia</span>
              <span class="tag">Rutinas</span>
            </div>
            <div class="post-actions">
              <button class="action-btn">
                <span>❤️</span>
                <span>24</span>
              </button>
              <button class="action-btn">
                <span>💬</span>
                <span>12 comentarios</span>
              </button>
              <button class="action-btn">
                <span>🔗</span>
                <span>Compartir</span>
              </button>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="post-card glass-card">
            <div class="post-header">
              <div class="post-avatar" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f59e0b, #d97706);">A</div>
              <div class="post-author">
                <span class="author-name">Ana Martínez</span>
                <span class="author-time">Hace 5 horas</span>
              </div>
              <span class="post-tag success">Logro</span>
            </div>
            <div class="post-content">
              <p>¡Quiero compartir un logro! Después de 3 meses aplicando las estrategias de comunicación que aprendí aquí, mi adolescente de 16 años finalmente empezó a compartir más sobre su día. ¡La paciencia y las herramientas funcionan!</p>
            </div>
            <div class="post-tags">
              <span class="tag">Comunicación</span>
              <span class="tag">Adolescentes</span>
              <span class="tag">Éxito</span>
            </div>
            <div class="post-actions">
              <button class="action-btn">
                <span>❤️</span>
                <span>56</span>
              </button>
              <button class="action-btn">
                <span>💬</span>
                <span>18 comentarios</span>
              </button>
              <button class="action-btn">
                <span>🔗</span>
                <span>Compartir</span>
              </button>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="post-card glass-card">
            <div class="post-header">
              <div class="post-avatar" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #6366f1, #8b5cf6);">M</div>
              <div class="post-author">
                <span class="author-name">María López</span>
                <span class="author-time">Ayer</span>
              </div>
              <span class="post-tag">Recurso</span>
            </div>
            <div class="post-content">
              <p>Encontré este artículo sobre neurociencia del sueño que me ayudó mucho. Lo comparto por si a alguien le sirve: "Los 5 errores que los padres cometemos al acostar a sus hijos". Básicamente, la luz azul y las rutinas inconsistentes son los principales culpables.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="post-tags">
              <span class="tag">Sueño</span>
              <span class="tag">Neurociencia</span>
              <span class="tag">Recomendación</span>
            </div>
            <div class="post-actions">
              <button class="action-btn">
                <span>❤️</span>
                <span>38</span>
              </button>
              <button class="action-btn">
                <span>💬</span>
                <span>8 comentarios</span>
              </button>
              <button class="action-btn">
                <span>🔗</span>
                <span>Compartir</span>
              </button>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="sidebar-section">
          <div class="groups-card glass-card">
            <h3>Tus grupos</h3>
            <div class="group-list">
              <div class="group-item">
                <div class="group-icon" style="background: rgba(236, 72, 153, 0.2);">👶</div>
                <div class="group-info">
                  <span class="group-name">Padres de primera infancia</span>
                  <span class="group-members">342 miembros</span>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="group-item">
                <div class="group-icon" style="background: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.2);">📚</div>
                <div class="group-info">
                  <span class="group-name">Club de lectura neuroeducación</span>
                  <span class="group-members">128 miembros</span>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="group-item">
                <div class="group-icon" style="background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.2);">🧘</div>
                <div class="group-info">
                  <span class="group-name">Mindfulness para padres</span>
                  <span class="group-members">89 miembros</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <button class="btn btn-outline btn-block">Explorar grupos</button>
          </div>

          <div class="events-card glass-card">
            <h3>Próximos eventos</h3>
            <div class="event-list">
              <div class="event-item">
                <div class="event-date">
                  <span class="day">28</span>
                  <span class="month">Mar</span>
                </div>
                <div class="event-info">
                  <span class="event-title">Webinar: Neurociencia del juego</span>
                  <span class="event-time">7:00 PM - 8:30 PM</span>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="event-item">
                <div class="event-date">
                  <span class="day">05</span>
                  <span class="month">Abr</span>
                </div>
                <div class="event-info">
                  <span class="event-title">Taller: Comunicación no violenta</span>
                  <span class="event-time">10:00 AM - 12:00 PM</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <button class="btn btn-outline btn-block">Ver todos los eventos</button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </main>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .app-layout {
    display: flex;
    min-height: 100vh;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  /* Sidebar */
  .sidebar {
    width: 260px;
    height: 100vh;
    position: fixed;
    left: 0;
    top: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    border-radius: 0;
    border-right: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
    border-left: none;
    border-top: none;
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  .sidebar-header {
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
  }

  .nav-logo {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .logo-icon {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
  }

  .sidebar-nav {
    flex: 1;
    padding: 1rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.25rem;
  }

  .nav-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    transition: all 0.2s;
  }

  .nav-item:hover {
    background: var(--glass-bg-hover);
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .nav-item.active {
    background: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.15);
    color: var(--accent-light);
  }

  .nav-icon {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
  }

  .sidebar-footer {
    padding: 1rem 1.5rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
  }

  .user-info {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .user-avatar {
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #6366f1, #8b5cf6);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: white;
  }

  .user-details {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .user-name {
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .user-plan {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--accent-light);
  }

  .logout-btn {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 0.5rem;
    background: transparent;
    border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.2s;
  }

  .logout-btn:hover {
    background: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.1);
    border-color: var(--danger);
    color: var(--danger);
  }

  /* Main Content */
  .main-content {
    flex: 1;
    margin-left: 260px;
    padding: 1.5rem 2rem;
  }

  .topbar {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .topbar h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .topbar-subtitle {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  /* Community Tabs */
  .community-tabs {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    padding-bottom: 1rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
  }

  .tab-btn {
    padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
    background: transparent;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 8px;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.2s;
  }

  .tab-btn:hover {
    background: var(--glass-bg);
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .tab-btn.active {
    background: var(--accent);
    color: white;
  }

  /* Community Content */
  .community-content {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 320px;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .feed-section {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .post-card {
    padding: 1.5rem;
  }

  .post-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .post-avatar {
    width: 44px;
    height: 44px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: white;
  }

  .post-author {
    flex: 1;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .author-name {
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .author-time {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .post-tag {
    padding: 0.25rem 0.75rem;
    background: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.15);
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--accent-light);
  }

  .post-tag.success {
    background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.15);
    color: var(--success);
  }

  .post-content {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .post-content p {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .post-tags {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .post-actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding-top: 1rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
  }

  .action-btn {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.375rem;
    padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem;
    background: transparent;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 6px;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.2s;
  }

  .action-btn:hover {
    background: var(--glass-bg);
    color: var(--text);
  }

  /* Sidebar Section */
  .sidebar-section {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .groups-card,
  .events-card {
    padding: 1.5rem;
  }

  .groups-card h3,
  .events-card h3 {
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .group-list,
  .event-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .group-item,
  .event-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    padding: 0.75rem;
    background: var(--glass-bg);
    border-radius: 8px;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.2s;
  }

  .group-item:hover,
  .event-item:hover {
    background: var(--glass-bg-hover);
  }

  .group-icon {
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
  }

  .group-info,
  .event-info {
    flex: 1;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .group-name,
  .event-title {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .group-members,
  .event-time {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .event-date {
    width: 44px;
    height: 44px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.15);
    border-radius: 8px;
  }

  .event-date .day {
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--accent-light);
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .event-date .month {
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    color: var(--accent-light);
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .btn-block {
    width: 100%;
  }

  /* Responsive */
  @media (max-width: 1024px) {
    .sidebar {
      width: 80px;
    }

    .sidebar-header .logo-text,
    .nav-item span:not(.nav-icon),
    .user-details,
    .logout-btn {
      display: none;
    }

    .nav-item {
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 0.75rem;
    }

    .user-info {
      justify-content: center;
    }

    .main-content {
      margin-left: 80px;
    }

    .community-content {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .sidebar-section {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .sidebar {
      display: none;
    }

    .main-content {
      margin-left: 0;
      padding: 1rem;
    }

    .topbar {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 1rem;
    }

    .community-tabs {
      overflow-x: auto;
      flex-wrap: nowrap;
    }

    .tab-btn {
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .sidebar-section {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
